ype":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20343,"speakerName":"Kabayama","textMapHash":2687989842,"text":"Perhaps there are many places more impressive than these. I mean, it is just dark down here, and there really isn't much variety in terms of food either. And we need to beware of the vishaps...","nextNodeIds":[722340307]},{"nodeId":722340307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20343,"speakerName":"Kabayama","textMapHash":2257723138,"text":"But now that I've lived here for so long, I feel attached to this place, you know? And I still miss those few spots of mine.","nextNodeIds":[722340308]},{"nodeId":722340308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20343,"speakerName":"Kabayama","textMapHash":388699442,"text":"Do you ever feel the same way? Even a place like this can be called home once you've stayed long enough.","nextNodeIds":[722340309,722340310]},{"nodeId":722340309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2022155682,"text":"Perhaps.","nextNodeIds":[722340311]},{"nodeId":722340311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20343,"speakerName":"Kabayama","textMapHash":2092393906,"text":"Is that so...","nextNodeIds":[722340312]},{"nodeId":722340312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20343,"speakerName":"Kabayama","textMapHash":3536405034,"text":"Well, thanks for hearing me out, in any case. I don't have much to give you in return, really, but please take these.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":722340310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2576171298,"text":"Not really.","nextNodeIds":[722340311]},{"nodeId":722340304,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":753767666,"text":"They were pretty run-of-the-mill. I've seen more impressive sights.","nextNodeIds":[722340305]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7223403,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":